+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to hash passwords with argon2id. It was chosen because it is memory-hard and resists GPU and ASIC-based cracking, with tunable cost parameters, as part of the project's security hardening. No specific cost parameter values (memory, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
